# The BACKEND service binding in wrangler.jsonc auto-connects to apps/worker's
# local `wrangler dev` session by name ("vinscout-worker") via Wrangler's local
# dev registry — no URL needed here. Just make sure apps/worker is running
# locally (npm run dev:worker) alongside this app.

# Must match apps/worker/.dev.vars's INTERNAL_PROXY_SECRET.
INTERNAL_PROXY_SECRET=local-dev-only-not-a-real-secret
